        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:selichot/penitential_third_day/adonai_boqer">
          <tei:pb n="121" ed="1912" facs="https://archive.org/download/selichothdavidasher1912/page/n244_medium.jpg"/>
          <tei:p>O Lord, in the morning thou hearest our voice; in the morning we will direct our prayers unto thee, and will look up. Do not abhor us for thy name’s sake; do not disgrace the throne of thy glory: remember, break not thy covenant with us. But as for me, my prayer is unto thee, O Lord, in an acceptable time: O God, in the multitude of thy mercy, hear me, in the truth of thy salvation. </tei:p>
        </tei:div>
